        "id": "ch14_3-1",
        "text": "Introducing IaaS solutions\nIaaS is the backbone of cloud computing. It offers on-demand access to resources, such as compute,\nstorage, network, and so on. The CSP uses hypervisors to provide IaaS solutions. In this section,\nwe provide you with information about some of the most widely used IaaS solutions available. We\nwill give you details about providers such as Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud ( Amazon EC2 ), and\nMicrosoft Azure Virtual Machines as the big players, and DigitalOcean as a viable solution. We will\ntackle OpenStack too, for those interested in what it could offer.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Amazon EC2\n\u2022 Microsoft Azure Virtual Machines\n\u2022 Other strong IaaS offerings\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
